SEARCHING PATTERN
Given some data, determine whether a target exists, and possibly find its position/value

1. Linear Search —Foundation telsukondii
Check every element one by one until you find the target

arr = [10, 5, 20, 8, 15]
target = 20

for i in range(len(arr)):            index:   0   1   2   3   4
    if arr[i] == target:             arr =   10   5  20   8  15
        print(i) # 2                                  |
                                                    Target

##Oka Pattern chudandii so don't memorize the code just Understand the thought process:
               I have a target
                       |
                Start from the beginning
                       |
                Compare current element with target
                       |
                Match?
                 ┌─────┴─────┐
                YES          NO            #Ilaa alochinchandi searching problemski
                 |            |
                Return       Continue
                              |
                          Next element

